{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/wraith-the-oblivion/1482715-do-wraiths-have-sex","id":1482715,"title":"Do Wraiths have Sex?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Wraith: The Oblivion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-01T22:39:43-07:00","id":1482715,"title":"Do Wraiths have Sex?","content":"As in title, Do Wraiths have Sex?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T23:01:24-07:00","id":1482716,"title":"","content":"I would say no. They have plasmic bodies, but not physical bodies so they wouldn't have physical urges to satisfy.<br /> <br /> But they do have emotional needs so there may be something wraiths do that still satisfy their needs for emotional intimacy. What that might be, I don't know. But it likely involves some kind of generation of Pathos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T23:16:20-07:00","id":1482717,"title":"","content":"They can. It\u2019s rare compared to the Quick because they don\u2019t have \u201cnormal\u201d hormones like the living do. But if one of their Passions relates to a sexual desire from life that is something that they may be drawn to indulge/recreate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-01T23:36:46-07:00","id":1482718,"title":"","content":"Just checking the entry for Puppetry on White Wolf Wiki. At 3, the Wraith could assist a timid host by using their arm to stroke the the neck of a theater date with their finger. At 4 +, I could see the Wraith fully indulging their Passions.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thank you for passing time with me in conversation. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1480242-horizon-s-wild-and-crazy-homebrew-rules-and-metaplot-choices\" target=\"_blank\">My Hacks</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26467-horizonparty2021","name":"HorizonParty2021","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26467_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"610"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T05:26:20-07:00","id":1482733,"title":"","content":"I'd say yes. Trying to separate emotional and physical urges for them is ultimately pointless because emotions Are physical urges driven by hormones and neurotransmitters, which wraiths have despite <i>not having</i> Hormones or Neurotransmitters because Magic.<br /> <br /> Just treat wraiths as normal people with wraith baggage added on rather than trying to tie your head into knots trying to figure out how a ghost's brain works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T08:16:37-07:00","id":1482765,"title":"","content":"I'd say they dont have the... Physiological responses, if you get my meaning.<br /> <br /> They still have the anatomy from their lives - there is, they have the sexual organs, but merely as aesthetics. They also keep the sexual dymorphism, in both primary and secondary characteristics. Those however are just aesthetics - and are &quot;collored&quot; by death marks, guild marks and molinate.<br /> <br /> They probably also keep the sexual preferences they had in life, alrhought that might change.<br /> <br /> Still, some still has &quot;sexual desire&quot;, but that would be a psychological wish rather than physical.<br /> <br /> As for Wraiths materialized or possessing someone, the strong feelings of the flesh would be overwhelming for them... And probably a delight they would love to feel","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24689-kakost","name":"Kakost","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"586"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-02T19:53:19-07:00","id":1482887,"title":"","content":"Wraith20 directly answers this question <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I don't have the page number, but here is the text:<br /> <br /> &quot;The Big Question<br /> <br /> Can wraiths have sex?<br /> <br /> In a word, yes. It goes without saying that Passion exists beyond the Shroud. And, when you consider things like Molitate and how a wraith's Corpus is subconsciously defined by self-image, let's just say that more than a few relic neckties have been metaphorically hung on relic doorknobs over the centuries.<br /> <br /> Pregnancy and childbirth, however, remain impossibilities.&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2317-callishka","name":"Callishka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2317_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"264"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-10T12:33:16-07:00","id":1483636,"title":"","content":"Also, the subject, as part of romance and intimate relationships as a genre and storytelling tool, is the focus of the classic sourcebook <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/193/Love-Beyond-Death\" target=\"_blank\">Love Beyond Death.</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>What is tolerance? It is the consequence of humanity. We are all formed of frailty and error; let us pardon reciprocally each other's folly. That is the first law of nature.</i><br /> Voltaire, &quot;Tolerance&quot; (1764)","edited":{"userid":12890,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","user":"No One of Consequence","date":". 06-10-2022, 03:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12890-no-one-of-consequence","name":"No One of Consequence","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12890_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3937"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}